### Update User Profile (Multipart Form Data with bodyData & optional profileImage)

PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/set-profile HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{mowafaq}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bodyData"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Mohammed Mowafaq / Mohammed Aldawod",
  "phone": "+96170123456",
  "gender": "Male"
}
--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="profileImage"; filename="avatar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./avatar.jpg
--WebAppBoundary--

### Change Password

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/change-password HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{mowafaq}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "oldPassword": "oldPassword123",
  "newPassword": "newPassword123"
}

### Send Forgot Password OTP

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com"
}

### Verify Forgot Password OTP

POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@gmail.com",
  "otp": "1234"
}

### Reset Password (After OTP Verification)

@forgetToken = YOUR_FORGET_TOKEN_HERE
# Note: Use the 'forgetToken' returned from verify-otp as the Authorization header value

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{forgetToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPassword": "newPassword123"
}
